  "title": "Bank7 Corp. Announces Q1 2026 Earnings",
  "summary": "April 14, 2026 Bank7 Corp. (NASDAQ: BSVN) (“the Company”), the parent company of Oklahoma City-based Bank7 (the “Bank”), today reported unaudited results for the quarter ended March 31, 2026. “We are pleased to announce record EPS, net income and PPE while maintaining a strong net interest margin, excellent credit quality, and robust liquidity. We are […]",
